LanguageData.TurboTick_FingerprintMismatch:
The dedicated server refused this client: the mod contents, load order or mod settings differ.
Local fingerprint: {0}
Per-file manifest: {1}
Diff that file against the host's copy to name the exact mod and file. Common causes: both the workshop and a local copy of the same mod are installed (the packageId gains a _steam suffix), a different Harmony build, or a mod the other side does not have.
